{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平在深圳會見來華出席亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議的美國總統特朗普。<br/>\n<br/>\n特朗普車隊中午後駛入麒麟山莊，央視報道，特朗普一行人下午1時許，抵達會見現場。<br/>\n<br/>\n這是兩國元首今年內第三次會晤。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：潘潔平\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:03:58.808040+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:35:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:25.139111+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:57:28.154274+00:00","content_hash":"67ec80be85acd52b7e7cb32ff3b3c65aab8986fffd8b398e8a753a23c88b41fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}